'''Candles''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife obtainable by purchasing the 6th tier of the [[Halloween Event 2024]] Battle Pass.

== Appearance ==
It uses the [[Default Knife|default knife]] mesh and has two lit candles: one is shorter, and the other is longer, hence the name.
